","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-11T06:59:34-07:00","id":1407494,"title":"","content":"You do understand the world is currently undergoing a pandemic? Even cyberpunk 2077 which has been in development for almost 8 years delayed it's release.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-11T07:10:32-07:00","id":1407498,"title":"","content":"Cyberpunk was to be relased in April 2020, It Will be out in november 2020, a 5 month delay.<br /> <br /> Bloodlines was expected in March 2020, then delayed to late 2020, and then skipped to the next year (without confirmed release date)<br /> <br /> Cyberpunk has tons of preview and coverage, there Is plenty of video, interview, preview from critics and live play. Bloodlines lack content, we know pretty much nothing about the game. <br /> <br /> CD project Is one of the biggest developers out there, the quality of their games Is well known, Hardsuit production is a smaller studio, with less resources and a worse curriculum<br /> It's quite different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 08-11-2020, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-11T07:23:13-07:00","id":1407500,"title":"","content":"Nah not really, but hey you keep saying the sky is falling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-11T07:27:32-07:00","id":1407502,"title":"","content":"If you think that a 6 month delay by one the biggest and most successfull developers out there (Who Is developing a giant open world bigger than the witcher 3) Is the same as a-more-than-a-year-delay from a small studio with a lesser scope game then I don't know what to say.<br /> <br /> Besides, this Is a list of the games out this year,now tell me how many were delayed for the pandemic (and most important thing: for how long, because a few months of delay are not the same thing as a 1 year delay without relase date)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/amp/s/www.gameinformer.com/2020%3famp\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/amp/s/www.gam...com/2020%3famp</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 08-11-2020, 10:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-11T08:28:16-07:00","id":1407509,"title":"","content":"The footage they have showed so far has been pretty shitty. Terrible graphics, animation and combat. It's a good thing that they are delaying. Hopefully they wont release it until late 2021 at the earliest. The game really needs the time to become half decent.<br /> <br /> This game is no way comparable to cyberpunk 2077. CD Project Red is one of the best game developer out there. What has Hardsuit Labs ever made? It's really a shame the gave this ip to such a mediocre studio.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24527-blackshade","name":"blackshade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-11T08:28:25-07:00","id":1407510,"title":"","content":"They've been sharing everything they've been doing on the development blog. You should go read what they've been up to. It sounds awesome.<br /> <br /> Admittedly, they've also admitted the reason they delayed was because they don't want to compete with Cyberpunk 2020.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I actually know a guy who lives across the street from the development studio.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_